{"path":"chrono/clock_t","title":"clock_t","titleHtml":"clock_t","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/chrono/clock_t","section":"chrono","kind":"page","summary":"Arithmetic(until C11)Real(since C11) type capable of representing the processor time used by a process. It has implementation-defined range and precision.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/chrono\"><code>&lt;time.h&gt;</code></a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw1\">typedef</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/* unspecified */</span> clock_t<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span class=\"t-rev-inl t-until-c11\"><span>Arithmetic</span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-c11\">(until C11)</span></span></span><span class=\"t-rev-inl t-since-c11\"><span>Real</span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(since C11)</span></span></span> type capable of representing the processor time used by a process. It has implementation-defined range and precision.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"c\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;time.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;math.h&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">volatile</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> sink<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n  clock_t start <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/c/chrono/clock\"><span class=\"kw514\">clock</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n  <span class=\"kw1\">for</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/c/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw100\">size_t</span></a> i<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> i<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">3141592</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>i<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n      sink<span class=\"sy2\">+</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/sin\"><span class=\"kw668\">sin</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>i<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n  clock_t end <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/c/chrono/clock\"><span class=\"kw514\">clock</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> cpu_time_used <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>end <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> start<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> <a href=\"/w/c/chrono/CLOCKS_PER_SEC\"><span class=\"kw522\">CLOCKS_PER_SEC</span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw850\">printf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"for loop took&nbsp;%f seconds to execute <span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>, cpu_time_used<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>for loop took 0.271828 seconds to execute</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-17\">\n<ul><li> C17 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2018): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.27.1/3 Components of time (p: 284)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div> \n<div class=\"t-ref-std-11\">\n<ul><li> C11 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2011): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.27.1/3 Components of time (p: 388)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div> \n<div class=\"t-ref-std-c99\">\n<ul><li> C99 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:1999): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.23.1/3 Components of time (p: 338)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div> \n<div class=\"t-ref-std-c89\">\n<ul><li> C89/C90 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:1990): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 4.12.1 Components of time \n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div> \n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/chrono/clock\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>clock</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   returns raw processor clock time since the program is started <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/chrono/CLOCKS_PER_SEC\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>CLOCKS_PER_SEC</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   number of processor clock ticks per second <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(macro constant)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/c/clock_t\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>clock_t</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"References","id":"References"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"},{"path":"chrono","title":"Date and time utilities"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"clock_t","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Arithmetic(until C11)Real(since C11) type capable of representing the processor time used by a process."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"References"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"clock","note":"returns raw processor clock time since the program is started"},{"label":"CLOCKS_PER_SEC","note":"number of processor clock ticks per second"}]}]},"standards":["C11"],"wordCount":151,"codeBlockCount":2}
